examples/reject/packages/dimension-wrong-kind/main.vast:18:1: E_DIMENSION: the physical metric `dimension_wrong_kind::PW` normalizes `x`, which its reading reads as `vastitas_dimension::Length`, by the scale `dimension_wrong_kind::w0` of `vastitas_dimension::Wavelength`; `normalized` needs a scale of the coordinate's own quantity, and an equal dimension is not enough
